      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "solid = request / control\ndashed = data read / cond.\n\nblue = backend step\ngreen = local memory\norange = shared memory\npurple = disk",
